{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112656","id":3614767312,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7XdPjQ","number":112656,"title":"`CharacterBody*D.get_gravity()` only considers changes to area overrides when moving","user":{"login":"azuresu","id":35944559,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1OTQ0NTU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35944559?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu","html_url":"https://github.com/azuresu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/azuresu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2025-11-12T03:49:13Z","updated_at":"2025-11-20T12:08:33Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot 4.5 stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.5 stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nCharacterBody3D.get_gravity() does NOT take account of the gravity settings in overlapping Area3D.\n\n1. Just create a scene and put a CharacterBody3d with a CollisionShape into it. Without anything else, its get_gravity() returns (0, -9.8, 0) which is the default gravity setting in the project;\n2. Now add an Area3D with a CollisionShape which overlaps with the character. Set Space Override in Graivty for the Area3D with another value;\n3. You will find get_gravity() still returns (0, -9.8, 0) which doesn't match what document says;\n4. Now change the character type to RigidBody3D, observe get_gravity() again, you will find the result is the combined calculation of project setting and area setting. It matches what document says.\n\nLink to the document:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_physicsbody3d.html#class-physicsbody3d-method-get-gravity\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee issue description.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112656/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}